{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/lb1.png?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Appalachian Mountains have been home to some of the most infamous cryptids, creatures, and folklore in America. In Blue Ridge Hunting, you'll team up with your friends to investigate, document, and hunt down these monsters. Explore large, open levels directly based on real-world locations, and come face-to-face with some of Appalachia's most feared beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/dewayo.gif?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/lb3.png?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Appalachian Investigation Group, and utilize various tools and items to collect evidence and track down creatures. Get paid for successful hunts, and use your money to invest in new equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creatures are always listening and looking; utilize proximity voice chat and your radio for communication, but be careful not to attract too much attention...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/lb2.png?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Atmospheric, retro/PSX artstyle inspired by early 3D games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proximity voice chat and radio communications that creatures can hear &amp; react to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Playable solo, or in teams of 1-5 in freeplay mode via online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-rich campaign mode (1-3 players) that tells the story of the Appalachian Investigation Group</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple unique creatures &amp; locations inspired by real places and legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original dark-bluegrass soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434930?t=1744687570","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434930?t=1744687570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/1c027df56a0db97a46d6593f0db48abd52ddbe6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744687570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/1c027df56a0db97a46d6593f0db48abd52ddbe6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744687570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"May contain content not appropriate for all ages, including horror, gore, alcohol and drug abuse, and discussions and/or depictions of traumatic events."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/lb1.png?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Appalachian Mountains have been home to some of the most infamous cryptids, creatures, and folklore in America. In Blue Ridge Hunting, you'll team up with your friends to investigate, document, and hunt down these monsters. Explore large, open levels directly based on real-world locations, and come face-to-face with some of Appalachia's most feared beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/dewayo.gif?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/lb3.png?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Appalachian Investigation Group, and utilize various tools and items to collect evidence and track down creatures. Get paid for successful hunts, and use your money to invest in new equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creatures are always listening and looking; utilize proximity voice chat and your radio for communication, but be careful not to attract too much attention...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434930/extras/lb2.png?t=1744687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Atmospheric, retro/PSX artstyle inspired by early 3D games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proximity voice chat and radio communications that creatures can hear &amp; react to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Playable solo, or in teams of 1-5 in freeplay mode via online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-rich campaign mode (1-3 players) that tells the story of the Appalachian Investigation Group</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple unique creatures &amp; locations inspired by real places and legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original dark-bluegrass soundtrack</p></li></ul>","developers":["Jade Meadows"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"ht